# Copy to identity.yml (or let proxmox-lxc.sh write it: APP_TARGETS="identity=<name>:9464") and put in the Tailscale
# name of the identity server's Proxmox container. Identity (github.com/Marcel-B/Identity) answers /metrics only on its
# own port 9464, plain http and only in the tailnet (deploy/proxmox/monitoring-einrichten.sh there); Funnel stays on 443.
- targets: [identity.example.ts.net:9464]
  labels:
    app: identity
    __scheme__: http
    __metrics_path__: /metrics
